imports this module. There is exactly one proof of the adapter in the tree.

The relocation costs nothing mathematically: the whole cluster uses only mathlib
together with `Nonempty (F →+* ℚ_[p])`, never `IsTotallySplitAt` itself.

The names here sit in `GaloisRepresentation`, the KW originals sat in
