then irreducible in `ℤ[X]`, so `ℤ[X] ⧸ (S₀)` is a domain of characteristic `0`,
hence `ℤ`-torsion-free, and so is its localisation at `g₀`. Therefore
`N · q ∈ J_ℤ` with `N ≠ 0` already forces `q ∈ J_ℤ`.

