/-- **THE DIVISIBLE-LEVEL node of the archimedean subtree** (PROVEN 2026-07-27
over `exists_realAbelianSchemeWithTensorLevelStructure` and
`divisibleTensorEquiv`; formerly the sorry leaf cut 2026-07-26
